infiltrator-software (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Implement Discover using the published Infiltrator application catalogue.
  * Add asynchronous HTTPS catalogue refresh with atomic offline cache fallback.
  * Verify repository-provided application icons by SHA-256 before caching.
  * Add live search, category filtering, application cards and provenance details.
  * Merge catalogue identities with local dpkg inventory to show Installed/Available state.
  * Keep installation disabled until complete transaction planning and authorization are implemented.

 -- Shannon Smith <infiltratr@yandex.com>  Sun, 20 Sep 2026 02:28:00 +1000

